#. USDZ export package, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:336.
msgid ""
"To export the Blender scene as a `USDZ archive "
"<https://openusd.org/release/spec_usdz.html>`__, set the file extension "
"of the output file to ``.usdz``.  The exported USDZ package will be a zip"
" archive containing the USD and its texture file dependencies."
msgstr ""
"För att exportera Blender-scenen som ett `USDZ-arkiv "
"<https://openusd.org/release/spec_usdz.html>`__ ställer du in "
"utdatafilens filtillägg till ``.usdz``. Det exporterade USDZ-paketet blir "
"ett ZIP-arkiv som innehåller USD och dess beroenden till texturfiler."

#. USD export root prim heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:356.
msgid "Root Prim"
msgstr "Rotprim"

#. USD export root prim description, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:357.
msgid ""
"If set, add a transform primitive with the given path to the stage as the"
" parent of all exported data."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är inställt läggs en transformprimitiv med den angivna "
"sökvägen till i USD-scenen som förälder till alla exporterade data."

#. USD export Blender data heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:373.
msgid "Blender Data"
msgstr "Blender-data"

#. USD custom attributes export, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:385.
msgid ""
"Author USD custom attributes containing the original Blender object and "
"object data names."
msgstr ""
"Skapa USD-anpassade attribut som innehåller de ursprungliga namnen på "
"Blender-objekt och objektdata."

#. USD stage units metadata, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:405.
msgid "Set the USD Stage ``metersPerUnit`` metadata to the chosen measurement."
msgstr "Ange USD-scenens ``metersPerUnit``-metadata till det valda måttet."

#. USD mesh export heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:426.
msgid "Exports :doc:`Mesh Objects </modeling/meshes/index>`"
msgstr "Exporterar :doc:`meshobjekt </modeling/meshes/index>`"

#. USD light export description, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:428.
msgid ""
"Exports :doc:`Light Objects </render/lights/index>` The "
"``UsdLuxShapingAPI`` is used to support spot lights."
msgstr ""
"Exporterar :doc:`ljusobjekt </render/lights/index>`. ``UsdLuxShapingAPI`` "
"används för att stödja spotlights."

#. USD camera export heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:435.
msgid ""
"Exports :doc:`Camera Objects </render/cameras>` Only perspective cameras "
"are exported."
msgstr ""
"Exporterar :doc:`kameraobjekt </render/cameras>`. Endast "
"perspektivkameror exporteras."

#. USD curve export heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:438.
msgid "Exports :doc:`Curve Objects </modeling/curves/index>`"
msgstr "Exporterar :doc:`kurvobjekt </modeling/curves/index>`"

#. USD point cloud export heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:440.
msgid "Exports :doc:`Point Cloud Objects </modeling/point_cloud/index>`"
msgstr "Exporterar :doc:`punktmolnsobjekt </modeling/point_cloud/index>`"

#. USD volume export heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:442.
msgid "Exports :doc:`Volume Objects </modeling/volumes/index>`"
msgstr "Exporterar :doc:`volymobjekt </modeling/volumes/index>`"

#. USD hair export, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:444.
msgid ""
"Exports parent hair strands are exported as a curve system. Hair strand "
"colors are not exported."
msgstr ""
"Exporterar föräldrahårstrån som ett kurvsystem. Hårstrånas färger "
"exporteras inte."

#. USD exported UV maps, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:457.
msgid ""
"When checked, includes UV coordinates for exported meshes. The name of "
"the UV map in USD is the same as the name in Blender."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är markerat inkluderas UV-koordinater för exporterade "
"mesh. Namnet på UV-kartan i USD är detsamma som namnet i Blender."
